title: "anthroDisturbance_Thesis: test suites (system, validation, sensitivity and uncertainty) for the anthropogenic disturbance modules"
version: v1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Kilian
    given-names: Ronald
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-1918-976X"
    affiliation: "Technische Universität Dresden"
  - family-names: Micheletti
    given-names: Tatiane
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4838-8342"
    affiliation: "Technische Universität Dresden"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RonCatK/RonCatK-anthroDisturbance_Thesis"
abstract: >-
  Test suites and run evidence for the SpaDES modules anthroDisturbance_DataPrep,
  potentialResourcesNT_DataPrep and anthroDisturbance_Generator: system stress
  tests under extreme configurations, validation of simulated against reference
  disturbance maps (allocation and quantity disagreement), Morris sensitivity
  analysis, and uncertainty analysis. The suites were executed in November and
  December 2025 on earlier module versions and were not repeated for module
  release v1.3.0. The repository holds configurations, runner and analysis
  scripts, and run ledgers; the modules themselves are referenced as git
  submodules and are not part of this archive.
keywords:
  - SpaDES
  - anthropogenic disturbance
  - simulation
  - model testing
  - sensitivity analysis
  - uncertainty analysis
  - R
